      "criteria": "Check that A and B are consistently associated with their intended body specifications and corresponding garment adaptations. If body dimensions are recorded, they must match A height/chest/waist/hip 1600/920/800/1000 mm and B 1850/1120/1000/1120 mm. Distinguish body dimensions from finished garment dimensions. Worn depictions should plausibly represent those adults without swapping the size identities; do not infer exact millimetres from unscaled renderings or require the body table to be printed.",
